{
  "dom_id": "step-q101234",
  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to the expression $7p-t+2r?$",
  "worked_solution": "The expression $7p-t+2r$ has three terms:  $7p$, $-t$, and $2r.$ \n\nThe order in which we combine the terms doesn't matter. Therefore, we can also write this expression as \n\n$$\n7p+2r-t.\n$$",
